<title>INDIA: Indian repos auction cut-off unchanged at 5.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Indian repos auction cut-off unchanged at 5.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) on Wednesday said it maintained the cut-off rate at five percent at its four-day repos auction of government of India securities.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received 17 bids for 16.6 billion rupees of which it accepted 14 for 16.4 billion.</p>
<p>The weighted-average cut-off rate worked out to 4.9495 percent, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
